      "correct": "3",
      "solution": "**Given:**\n\nDecimal number = 1.222...\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nFor repeating decimals, let x = given number, multiply to shift the repeating part, subtract equations, and solve for x.\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nLet x = 1.222...\n\nMultiply both sides by 10 to shift the repeating part:\n\n10x = 12.222...\n\nSubtract the first equation from this:\n\n10x - x = 12.222... - 1.222...\n\n⇒ 9x = 11\n\n⇒ x = 11 / 9\n\n**The equivalent fraction of 1.222... is (11/9).**",
